"line":92},{"w":"more","s":291.4,"e":291.66,"line":92},{"w":"than","s":291.66,"e":291.88,"line":92},{"w":"every","s":291.88,"e":292.42,"line":92},{"w":"margin,","s":292.42,"e":292.7,"line":92},{"w":"fee,","s":292.88,"e":293.14,"line":92},{"w":"and","s":293.14,"e":293.38,"line":92},{"w":"score,","s":293.38,"e":293.88,"line":92},{"w":"The","s":294.42,"e":294.6,"line":93},{"w":"people","s":294.6,"e":295,"line":93},{"w":"with","s":295,"e":295.36,"line":93},{"w":"the","s":295.36,"e":295.64,"line":93},{"w":"least","s":295.64,"e":296.22,"line":93},{"w":"won’t","s":296.22,"e":296.57,"line":93},{"w":"have","s":296.92,"e":297.16,"line":93},{"w":"to","s":297.16,"e":297.48,"line":93},{"w":"pay","s":297.48,"e":297.8,"line":93},{"w":"the","s":297.8,"e":298.12,"line":93},{"w":"most","s":298.12,"e":298.62,"line":93},{"w":"anymore.","s":298.62,"e":299.66,"line":93},{"w":"Read","s":301.66,"e":301.74,"line":95},{"w":"the","s":301.7,"e":302.26,"line":95},{"w":"Scripture,","s":302.26,"e":302.4,"line":95},{"w":"live","s":302.4,"e":302.64,"line":95},{"w":"the","s":302.64,"e":303.78,"line":95},{"w":"meaning.","s":303.78,"e":304.12,"line":95},{"w":"Feed","s":304.52,"e":305.12,"line":96},{"w":"the","s":305.12,"e":305.66,"line":96},{"w":"hungry,","s":305.66,"e":305.92,"line":96},{"w":"fight","s":306.22,"e":306.3,"line":96},{"w":"the","s":306.28,"e":307.5,"line":96},{"w":"greed.","s":307.5,"e":307.72,"line":96},{"w":"Faith","s":307.72,"e":308.94,"line":97},{"w":"becomes","s":308.94,"e":309.48,"line":97},{"w":"a","s":309.48,"e":309.72,"line":97},{"w":"force","s":309.72,"e":310,"line":97},{"w":"for","s":310,"e":311.04,"line":97},{"w":"freedom","s":311.04,"e":311.12,"line":97},{"w":"When","s":311.04,"e":311.8,"line":98},{"w":"belief","s":311.8,"e":312.42,"line":98},{"w":"becomes","s":312.42,"e":313.66,"line":98},{"w":"a","s":313.66,"e":314.3,"line":98},{"w":"deed.","s":314.3,"e":314.38,"line":98}],"lines":[{"s":6.096,"e":17.515,"text":"# **The Least Pay the Most**"},{"s":17.515,"e":18.015,"text":"**[Intro]**"},{"s":20.32,"e":24.76,"text":"They built a brutal business where the broke pay more,"},{"s":24.76,"e":28.2,"text":"Then boast about the Bible from a gold-trimmed floor."},{"s":28.2,"e":31.64,"text":"They praise a peaceful Prophet, then profit from the poor—"},{"s":31.64,"e":37.08,"text":"Preaching grace on Sunday, Monday guarding greed’s front door."},{"s":37.08,"e":37.58,"text":"**[Verse 1]**"},{"s":42.3,"e":45.88,"text":"Balance barely breathing, bank account in red,"},{"s":45.88,"e":49.36,"text":"Bankers bite another fee from money already dead."},{"s":49.6,"e":52.94,"text":"Five dollars in the negative, thirty-five gets drained,"},{"s":53.74,"e":56.34,"text":"Poverty gets punished while the profit gets proclaimed."},{"s":56.34,"e":59.62,"text":"Bills bounce badly, penalties pile,"},{"s":59.64,"e":63.18,"text":"Fees breed fees in a fatal file."},{"s":63.74,"e":66.86,"text":"Paycheck posts late, but the landlord won’t wait,"},{"s":67.02,"e":70.58,"text":"So the poor pay a premium for arriving past the date."},{"s":71.32,"e":73.78,"text":"Credit costs the most when you need it to cope,"},{"s":74.06,"e":77.26,"text":"Payday lenders package desperation up as hope."},{"s":77.22,"e":80.88,"text":"The wealthy win low rates and lock their wealth in stores;"},{"s":81.48,"e":84.62,"text":"Workers borrow just to keep some supper in the drawers."},{"s":84.62,"e":85.12,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":84.62,"e":88.06,"text":"Every office offers obstacles and demands,"},{"s":88.96,"e":91.68,"text":"Every lifeline leaves a ledger in your hands."},{"s":92,"e":95.2,"text":"They swear the system’s equal since the statutes stay the same,"},{"s":95.48,"e":98.8,"text":"But a spark costs more when you’re already in the flame."},{"s":98.8,"e":99.3,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":99,"e":102.04,"text":"The least pay the most, coast to coast,"},{"s":102.04,"e":105.42,"text":"For a room, a ride, the right to stay afloat."},{"s":105.8,"e":109.12,"text":"Banks take bites and the DMV takes days,"},{"s":109.18,"e":112.88,"text":"Every system sells survival in a hundred hidden ways."},{"s":112.88,"e":116.14,"text":"They quote Christ clearly, then contradict His call,"},{"s":116.58,"e":119.94,"text":"Sing about the Savior while the starving scrape the wall."},{"s":120.16,"e":123.4,"text":"One penny from the poor holds more than fortunes from the rich,"},{"s":123.5,"e":126.96,"text":"Still churches cheer the wealthy while the poor stay in the ditch."},{"s":126.96,"e":127.46,"text":"**[Verse 2]**"},{"s":127.5,"e":129.82,"text":"Need a car for the career, need the career for the car,"},{"s":129.84,"e":131.36,"text":"Need a license from an office painfully far."},{"s":131.6,"e":133.32,"text":"Miss a morning making money, spend the afternoon in line,"},{"s":133.38,"e":135.1,"text":"Government grabs your wages while it wastes away your time."},{"s":135.16,"e":136.84,"text":"Booked back in April, still you wait into the night,"},{"s":136.88,"e":138.36,"text":"Bring a birth certificate—they claim it isn’t right."},{"s":138.38,"e":140.28,"text":"One box blank, back you go, brokenhearted through the door,"},{"s":140.28,"e":142.38,"text":"The DMV keeps demonstrating: poor folks pay more."},{"s":142.4,"e":144.28,"text":"No paid leave, so you labor while your lungs burn sick,"},{"s":144.36,"e":146.3,"text":"Lose one shift and eviction starts to count down quick."},{"s":146.3,"e":147.86,"text":"Can’t afford the clinic, so the sickness settles deep,"},{"s":147.88,"e":150.48,"text":"Then the ambulance adds anguish with a bill you cannot beat."},{"s":150.7,"e":154.04,"text":"Cheap shoes crack quickly, so you purchase pair on pair,"},{"s":154.38,"e":157.56,"text":"Cheap meals ease the hunger while they slowly strip your health."},{"s":157.78,"e":160.84,"text":"The rich buy quality once; the poor replace and replace,"},{"s":161.3,"e":165.88,"text":"Then society scolds the struggling with a shameless face."},{"s":165.88,"e":166.38,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":165.92,"e":168.86,"text":"The least pay the most, coast to coast,"},{"s":168.86,"e":172.3,"text":"For a meal, medicine, a modest bit of hope."},{"s":172.82,"e":175.94,"text":"Courts collect cash and the DMV takes days,"},{"s":176.02,"e":179.86,"text":"Every system sells survival in a hundred hidden ways."},{"s":180.02,"e":182.9,"text":"They quote Christ clearly, then contradict His call,"},{"s":183.08,"e":186.72,"text":"Build enormous temples while their neighbors beg and crawl."},{"s":186.8,"e":190.24,"text":"One penny from the poor holds sacrifice within;"},{"s":190.24,"e":193.88,"text":"One dollar from abundance doesn’t wash away your sin."},{"s":193.88,"e":194.38,"text":"**[Bridge]**"},{"s":193.94,"e":197.44,"text":"You memorize the message, mark the margins, quote the page,"},{"s":197.44,"e":200.86,"text":"Then ignore the aching people crushed beneath the weight."},{"s":201.44,"e":204.72,"text":"You raise your hands to heaven, sing salvation sweet and loud,"},{"s":204.92,"e":208.46,"text":"Then pass a freezing person like a shadow in the crowd."},{"s":208.58,"e":211.92,"text":"You know each sacred sentence, every sermon, every song,"},{"s":212.24,"e":215.52,"text":"But faith without fair action is a fraud that funds the wrong."},{"s":215.82,"e":219.06,"text":"You say the meek are mighty, say the last will lead the first,"},{"s":219.1,"e":222.44,"text":"Then maintain the very machines that make their misery worse."},{"s":222.66,"e":226.92,"text":"Banks benefit from brokenness, courts capitalize on fate,"},{"s":226.92,"e":229.86,"text":"Landlords leverage hunger, leaders manufacture hate."},{"s":230.22,"e":233.44,"text":"The danger isn’t distant; it is printed on the fee,"},{"s":233.66,"e":237.38,"text":"Glowing green above the counter at the local DMV."},{"s":237.38,"e":237.88,"text":"**[Breakdown]**"},{"s":238.84,"e":240.08,"text":"Thirty-five because you lacked five—"},{"s":240.12,"e":241.9,"text":"They call that keeping banking alive."},{"s":241.9,"e":243.62,"text":"Late rent fee because rent was late—"},{"s":243.64,"e":245.4,"text":"They deepen the ditch, then debate your fate."},{"s":245.42,"e":247.24,"text":"But people pressed together can pressure every wall,"},{"s":247.38,"e":248.98,"text":"A thousand steady voices can outshout one marble hall."},{"s":249.18,"e":250.78,"text":"Mercy made into policy, dignity made law—"},{"s":250.78,"e":254.24,"text":"We can build a better system than the broken one we saw."},{"s":254.24,"e":254.74,"text":"**[Final Chorus]**"},{"s":254.24,"e":258.14,"text":"The least pay the most—but we won’t anymore,"},{"s":258.4,"e":262.16,"text":"We’ll bring the buried burden to the public’s front door."},{"s":262.22,"e":265.38,"text":"Banks took bites and the DMV took days,"},{"s":265.5,"e":268.94,"text":"Now we’re naming every punishment and changing every way."},{"s":269.1,"e":272.28,"text":"Stop quoting Christ as camouflage for coldness and control,"},{"s":272.36,"e":276.16,"text":"Start feeding every body, start protecting every soul."},{"s":276.24,"e":279.32,"text":"That penny from the poor is a precious piece of breath;"},{"s":279.26,"e":283.06,"text":"Let compassion become practice, not a promise after death."},{"s":283.38,"e":286.48,"text":"The world may stand in peril, but the people still have power,"},{"s":286.86,"e":290.1,"text":"Every hand can help a neighbor, every voice can move the hour."},{"s":290.38,"e":293.88,"text":"When mercy matters more than every margin, fee, and score,"},{"s":294.42,"e":299.66,"text":"The people with the least won’t have to pay the most anymore."},{"s":299.66,"e":300.16,"text":"**[Outro]**"},{"s":301.66,"e":304.12,"text":"Read the Scripture, live the meaning."},{"s":304.52,"e":307.72,"text":"Feed the hungry, fight the greed."},{"s":307.72,"e":311.12,"text":"Faith becomes a force for freedom"},{"s":311.04,"e":314.38,"text":"When belief becomes a deed."}],"duration":327.2,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-29T02:49:44.560Z","stats":{"whisperWords":821,"polishedWords":813,"matched":751,"matchRate":0.924}}